# What not to upload to Vercel. Without this the CLI packs `template/`'s Gradle output — 2.7GB on
# any machine that has ever built it — to deliver the 1.5MB the container actually needs.
#
# `template/` and `generator/` themselves must stay: the API service is a container built from the
# repository root, and they are its payload.

**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/.idea/
**/__pycache__/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.cxx
**/captures/

# Signing material and anything that has ever held a secret.
**/local.properties
**/keystore.properties
**/keys/
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
